
### If you can't install sing-box (CN / RU App Store)

The CN App Store has banned all VPN/proxy apps; RU App Store availability
fluctuates. **Canonical fix**: switch your Apple ID region to a non-RU/non-
CN country (US, UK, etc.) and install sing-box from that store. Settings →
your name → Media & Purchases → Country/Region.

If region-switching isn't workable, you can install a different proxy
client and import a **per-protocol single-outbound profile** instead. Each
file contains exactly one outbound, so there's nothing for an alternate
client's auto-switcher (e.g. Hiddify-Next, see Troubleshooting) to override.
You import one file per protocol you want available, and switch protocol by
switching profiles inside the alternate client.

